# Live-testing scratch space. Raw saved pages, screenshots, and notes taken while
# testing against real retailers — working files, not fixtures. A fixture is sanitized,
# minimized, and committed under packages/extractors/src/fixtures/; anything here has not
# been through that and may still carry account details, order history, or tokens.
.live/

